{
    "id": "task1",
    "chapterId": "ch_8",
    "title": "Create an Accessible Video Player Component",
    "description": "Build a custom video player with keyboard support, captions button, and slider controls.",
    "estimatedMinutes": 25,
    "problemStatement": "## Build an Accessible Video Player\n\nCreate a custom video player that wraps a native `<video>` element. The player must include:\n\n1. A play/pause toggle button (updates `aria-label` and `aria-pressed`).\n2. A mute/unmute button.\n3. A captions toggle button (show/hide captions) – the video must have at least one `<track kind=\"captions\">`.\n4. A seek bar (using `<input type=\"range\">` for native slider, update `aria-valuetext` with time).\n5. A volume slider.\n6. Current time and duration display.\n7. All buttons must be keyboard accessible; the player must respond to standard shortcuts: Space (play/pause), Left/Right arrow (seek ±5s), Up/Down arrow (volume ±0.1).\n8. The native video controls must be hidden.\n\nProvide HTML, CSS (basic styling), and JavaScript. Use a sample video URL (e.g., Big Buck Bunny) and a sample VTT file (or just the track element pointing to a placeholder VTT file).",
    "hints": [
        "Use `video.play()`, `video.pause()`, `video.muted`, `video.currentTime`, `video.textTracks[0].mode = 'showing'|'hidden'`.",
        "For the seek bar, update `value` on `timeupdate` event.",
        "Prevent default Space/arrow key handling to avoid scrolling."
    ],
    "expectedOutput": "A working video player with full keyboard and screen reader accessibility.",
    "solutionCode": "<!-- HTML -->\n<div class=\"custom-player\">\n  <video id=\"video\" src=\"https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/gtv-videos-bucket/sample/BigBuckBunny.mp4\">\n    <track kind=\"captions\" src=\"captions.vtt\" srclang=\"en\" label=\"English\" default>\n  </video>\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button id=\"play-btn\" aria-label=\"Play\" aria-pressed=\"false\">▶</button>\n    <span id=\"current-time\">0:00</span>\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"seek-bar\" value=\"0\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Seek\" aria-valuetext=\"0 seconds\">\n    <span id=\"duration\">0:00</span>\n    <button id=\"mute-btn\" aria-label=\"Mute\" aria-pressed=\"false\">🔊</button>\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"volume-bar\" value=\"1\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" aria-label=\"Volume\" aria-valuetext=\"100%\">\n    <button id=\"cc-btn\" aria-label=\"Enable captions\" aria-pressed=\"false\">CC</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const video = document.getElementById('video');\n  const playBtn = document.getElementById('play-btn');\n  const muteBtn = document.getElementById('mute-btn');\n  const ccBtn = document.getElementById('cc-btn');\n  const seekBar = document.getElementById('seek-bar');\n  const volumeBar = document.getElementById('volume-bar');\n  const currentTimeSpan = document.getElementById('current-time');\n  const durationSpan = document.getElementById('duration');\n\n  video.addEventListener('loadedmetadata', () => {\n    durationSpan.textContent = formatTime(video.duration);\n    seekBar.max = video.duration;\n  });\n  video.addEventListener('timeupdate', () => {\n    seekBar.value = video.currentTime;\n    seekBar.setAttribute('aria-valuetext', Math.round(video.currentTime) + ' seconds');\n    currentTimeSpan.textContent = formatTime(video.currentTime);\n  });\n  seekBar.addEventListener('input', () => {\n    video.currentTime = seekBar.value;\n  });\n  volumeBar.addEventListener('input', () => {\n    video.volume = volumeBar.value;\n    video.muted = false;\n    updateMuteButton();\n  });\n\n  playBtn.addEventListener('click', togglePlay);\n  muteBtn.addEventListener('click', toggleMute);\n  ccBtn.addEventListener('click', toggleCaptions);\n\n  function togglePlay() {\n    if (video.paused) { video.play(); playBtn.textContent = '⏸'; playBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Pause'); playBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true'); }\n    else { video.pause(); playBtn.textContent = '▶'; playBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Play'); playBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); }\n  }\n  function toggleMute() {\n    video.muted = !video.muted;\n    updateMuteButton();\n  }\n  function updateMuteButton() {\n    if (video.muted) { muteBtn.textContent = '🔇'; muteBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Unmute'); muteBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true'); }\n    else { muteBtn.textContent = '🔊'; muteBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Mute'); muteBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); }\n  }\n  function toggleCaptions() {\n    const track = video.textTracks[0];\n    if (track.mode === 'showing') {\n      track.mode = 'hidden';\n      ccBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Enable captions');\n      ccBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');\n    } else {\n      track.mode = 'showing';\n      ccBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Disable captions');\n      ccBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');\n    }\n  }\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.target.tagName === 'INPUT') return; // don't intercept slider keys\n    if (e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); togglePlay(); }\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') { e.preventDefault(); video.currentTime += 5; }\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') { e.preventDefault(); video.currentTime -= 5; }\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowUp') { e.preventDefault(); video.volume = Math.min(1, video.volume + 0.1); volumeBar.value = video.volume; }\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowDown') { e.preventDefault(); video.volume = Math.max(0, video.volume - 0.1); volumeBar.value = video.volume; }\n  });\n\n  function formatTime(seconds) {\n    const mins = Math.floor(seconds / 60);\n    const secs = Math.floor(seconds % 60);\n    return `${mins}:${secs.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;\n  }\n</script>\n<style>\n  .custom-player { position: relative; width: 640px; }\n  video { width: 100%; }\n  .controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #222; padding: 10px; }\n  button { background: none; border: none; color: white; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer; }\n  input[type='range'] { flex: 1; }\n</style>"
}